  m_text: "An official hospital medical report documenting Lin Fang's injuries. The
    examination records multiple bruises and soft tissue injuries to the head, neck,
    chest, and upper limbs, along with localized swelling and tenderness. \n\nThe
    report also includes the diagnosis, treatment recommendations, examination date,
    attending physician's signature, and the official hospital seal."
